Controls:
	File:
		Ctrl-O: Open a pdf document
		Ctrl-Q: Quit (preferences will be saved)

	Fullscreen:
		Ctrl-F: Fullscreen

	Reading mode:
		p: Switch to Page mode (only the full pages are displayed)
		s: Switch to Strip mode (display in strips mode, based on window/page width)
		c: Switch to Case mode (display each case of the comics when possible)
	
	Navigation:
		Left arrow: Go to previous case/previous strip (to previous page in Page mode)
		Right arrow: Go to next case/next strip (to next page in Page mode)
		Bottom arrow: Go to previous page
		Top arrow: Go to next page
		Mouse wheel up: Go to previous case/strip/page
		Mouse wheel down: Go to next case/strip/page
